WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:03.211
A gold record, further away than anything.

00:03.911 --> 00:08.462
Bolted to the side of this spacecraft is a gold-plated record.

00:08.912 --> 00:18.356
It carries whale song, greetings in fifty-five languages, and one woman's heartbeat, recorded two days after she decided to get married.
